Hello in FrenchBonjour! In French, "hello" is translated as "bonjour". It's used in both formal and informal situations to greet someone. For example, you can say "bonjour" when answering the phone or starting a conversation with someone.en EspanolHola! ¿En qué puedo ayudarte hoy? (Hello! How can I assist you today?)Goodbye!Au revoir! À bientôt! (Goodbye! See you soon!)